<view class="page">
  <view class="about-hero">
    <view class="hero-icon">🎁</view>
    <view>
      <view class="page-title">关于送了莫</view>
      <view class="page-subtitle">不知道送什么？三步帮你选。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="intro-card">
    <view class="intro-title">纯工具型礼物推荐助手</view>
    <view class="intro-text">
      送了莫用于帮你快速整理送礼思路：先确认场景，再确认收礼人和预算，最后得到礼物灵感、鲜花花语和注意事项。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card">
    <view class="section-title">使用说明</view>
    <view class="step-list">
      <view class="step-item" wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="title">
        <view class="step-index">{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view class="step-content">
          <view class="step-title">{{item.title}}</view>
          <view class="section-text">{{item.desc}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card">
    <view class="section-title">当前已覆盖</view>
    <view class="bullet-item" wx:for="{{highlights}}" wx:key="*this">
      <text class="bullet-dot">•</text>
      <text>{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card">
    <view class="section-title">功能边界</view>
    <view class="section-text">送了莫面向「工具 → 效率」类目，只做灵感整理和本地提醒。</view>
    <view class="bullet-item" wx:for="{{boundaries}}" wx:key="*this">
      <text class="bullet-dot">•</text>
      <text>{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card">
    <view class="section-title">免责声明</view>
    <view class="section-text">
      推荐仅供参考，价格可能随时间、地区和渠道变化。请优先尊重收礼人的真实喜好、禁忌、过敏情况和双方关系边界。
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="share-button" open-type="share">分享送了莫</button>
  <navigator class="home-link" open-type="redirect" url="/pages/index/index">返回首页选礼物</navigator>
</view>
